      "skos:definition": "The primary GDHCN glossary: the 21 definitions in Section II of the GDHCN Administrative and Operational Framework (version 1.2, 9 October 2026), quoted word for word. The Framework is the legal source document for GDHCN (owner, 2026-11-01), and it says the definitions 'apply herein'. Terms this IG adds go in a separate scheme and never override a definition here.",
